Label: spatially disjoint from
Annotations: expand_assertion_to &quot;DisjointClasses: (http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051 some ?X)  (http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051 some ?Y)&quot;
</obo:IAO_0000112>
