        <oboInOwl:id>CHMO:0010016</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>the range of &apos;prevents&apos; is an adverse laboratory event (process). The object that prevents the ALE blocks a disposition that is manifested as the ALE. Example: water blocks flammability. From a safety officer pov, this is about planning.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>prevents</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


