        <rdfs:comment>the range of &apos;mitigates&apos; is an adverse laboratory event (process). The object that mitigates the ALE has the capability (disposition) to take part in the process and prevent downstream adverse events. From a safety officer pov, this is about responding.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>mitigates</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


