        <owl:annotatedTarget>A stripping voltammetry in which the analyte of interest is first electroplated onto the working electrode before being removed or &apos;stripped&apos; by applying an oxidising potential.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0640-0422</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
