        <obo:IAO_0000115>A method for determining structure by measuring the change in direction or energy of scattered neutrons at wide angles (corresponding to Q &gt; 1 inverse degrees).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>WANS</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
