        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0000192"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A method for determining structure by measuring the change in direction or energy of scattered neutrons and the time since the indicent pulse (&apos;time-of-flight&apos;) for each neutron. Neutrons are scattered by the atomic nuclei in the sample, and suffer a loss of kinetic energy during collisions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
