        <obo:IAO_0000115>A method for determining structure by measuring the velocity of neutrons in known magnetic fields before and after scattering at small angles by a magnetic sample. The neutrons are scattered by the interaction of neutron spin with spins in the sample (&apos;spin echo&apos;).</obo:IAO_0000115>
