        <obo:IAO_0000115>An electron spectroscopy where a high energy photon ionises a core electron and an electron from a higher energy level descends to take its place, releasing sufficient energy to eject a second so-called &apos;Auger&apos; electron and the energy of the Auger electron is detected as a function of incident photon energy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
