        <obo:IAO_0000115>A heteronuclear two-dimensional nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy in which a second frequency dimension is employed to disperse the signals and reveal correlations between protons and the nuclei to which they are covalently bound. In HSQC only the magnetisation of one nucleus is allowed to evolve over time.</obo:IAO_0000115>
