        <obo:IAO_0000115>Mass spectrometry where the sample is ionised in a plasma (a partially ionised gas–-such as Ar–-containing free electrons) which has been generated by an electrical discharge.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>discharge MS</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>CHMO:0000741</oboInOwl:id>
