        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>SMSERS</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>single molecule surface enhanced Raman scattering</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>single molecule surface enhanced Raman scattering spectroscopy</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>single molecule surface-enhanced Raman scattering</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>single molecule surface-enhanced Raman scattering spectroscopy</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>single molecule surface-enhanced Raman spectroscopy</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
