        <obo:IAO_0000115>An &quot;activation analysis [in which the sample is bombarded] using neutrons&quot;, the capture of which results in the generation of radioactive nuclei for most elements in the sample. These activated nuclei then decay according to their characteristic half-lives.</obo:IAO_0000115>
