        <obo:IAO_0000115>A spectroscopy for probing the free volume between polymer chains in which the anti-particle of an electron (a positron) is injected, from a radioactive source into the sample. When the positron is annihilated a characteristic energy is emitted, and the time from injection to energy emission is measured.</obo:IAO_0000115>
