        <owl:annotatedTarget>Spectroscopy where the Raman scattering of near-infrared radiation (radiation in the range 0.8–2 μm) is detected.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0640-0422</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
