        <obo:IAO_0000115>The study of radiation as a function of wavelength that has been transmitted through a sample.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>transmission spectrometry</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>transmittance spectrometry</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
