        <owl:annotatedTarget>A piece of apparatus which is used to generate an image of the surface of a specimen, whether by focusing reflected light onto where it can be collected or by scanning a given area of the surface.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5985-7429</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
