            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mass spectrometer that uses an electron ionisation source, which consists of a thin strip of metal that is heated electrically to incandescence or a temperature at which it emits free electrons that are accelerated through a potential to an energy where they ionise the sample.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>electron ionization mass spectrometer</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>EI MS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
