        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mass-to-charge analyser that consists of a set of four linear electrodes and allows only ions of a given mass-to-charge ratio, set according to the direct current and radio frequency potentials, to reach a detector.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>QMF</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
