        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0000966"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mass-to-charge analyser that consists of two coaxial axially symmetric electrodes, the outer one in the shape of a barrel, the inner one in the shape of a spindle, that traps ions in oscillating trajectories along the z-axis according to their mass-to-charge ratio.</obo:IAO_0000115>
