        <obo:IAO_0000115>An electrokinetic &quot;chromatography, where the movement of the mobile phase through a capillary [...] is achieved by electroosmotic flow. [...] The retention time is determined by a combination of electrophoretic migration and chromatographic retention.&quot;</obo:IAO_0000115>
