    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0001048">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A method in which a separation method is coupled to a measurement method in order to perform measurements upon different components of a sample.</obo:IAO_0000115>
