        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0001117"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An NMR experiment in which pulsed field gradients are applied to a spin echo sequence to cleanly and precisely excite particular resonances. Additionally, attenuation of signals occurs related to molecular diffusion allowing this technique to be used to determine self-diffusion coefficients.</obo:IAO_0000115>
