        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A method for determining surface area by measuring the amount of an inert gaseous or liquid substance (the &apos;sorbent&apos;, usually H2 or N2) which adsorbs onto the surface of interest (the &apos;sorbate&apos;), and the subsequent amount that desorbs at a constant temperature. Regression analysis is then applied to the data, resulting in an isotherm.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5985-7429</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2009-03-13T01:27:03Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
