        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>2D 1H-NOESY spectrum</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>2D 1H-NOESY-NMR spectra</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>2D 1H-NOESY-NMR spectrum</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
