        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Hadamard encoded NMR</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Hadamard nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Hadamard-encoded NMR</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
