        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0001247"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A method for measuring density-of-state (DOS) distributions by injecting a nonequilibrium density of charges and measuring the resulting current.</obo:IAO_0000115>
