        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0001314"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A synthesis method where the substrate is exposed to one or more involatile precursors, suspended in a liquid–gas aerosol (generated ultrasonically), which react or decompose on the surface to produce a deposit.</obo:IAO_0000115>
