        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0001356"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A synthesis technique where an electric arc is used to vaporize material from a cathode target. The vaporized material then condenses on a substrate, forming a thin film.</obo:IAO_0000115>
