        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process of filling in the pores of a material (e.g. a ceramic) by reaction with, or deposition from a vapour held at high pressure.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>forced-flow CVI</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
