        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A form of curing process in which a prepolymer is converted into a polymer and then into a network, upon irradiation with light.</owl:annotatedTarget>
