        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000094"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A material processing in which a solute is transferred from a liquid phase to another immiscible or partially-miscible liquid phase in contact with it.</obo:IAO_0000115>
