        <owl:annotatedTarget>An extraction in which two solutes from a liquid phase are transferred to a (low-polarity) organic liquid phase in contact with it. The solutes form &quot;mixed-species aggregates in a low-polarity organic phase.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
