        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0001579"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A headspace extraction in which once the concentration of the analyte in the headspace is in equilibrium with the concentration in the sample matrix, the headspace is removed. The process is repeated multiple times, allowing the new equilibrium to form at each stage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
