        <obo:IAO_0000115>A process used to create objects of a fixed cross-sectional profile by forcing or drawing a material through a die.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>extrusion molding</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
