        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0001658"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any ionisation method when the sample is ionised in a plasma–-a partially ionised gas (such as Ar) containing free electrons.</obo:IAO_0000115>
