        <obo:IAO_0000115>Mass spectrometry where a solid sample is vaporised by depositing it on a probe which is rapidly heated (to &lt;1000 °C) by passing a current through it. The vaporised sample is ionised in a plasma (a partially ionised gas–-such as Ar–-containing free electrons) which has been generated by electromagnetic induction.</obo:IAO_0000115>
