        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>low-temperature electrothermal vaporization inductively coupled plasma mass spectrometry</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>CHMO:0001791</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>low-temperature electrothermal vaporisation inductively coupled plasma mass spectrometry</rdfs:label>
