        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>dynamic mode AFM</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>dynamic scanning force microscopy in attractive regime</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>dynamic-mode AFM</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
