        <obo:IAO_0000115>The measurement of thermodynamic parameters (e.g. enthalpy) during a chemical or biochemical reaction of both a sample and a reference, by the known variation (step-wise or linear) of temperature whilst a second variable is kept constant. The power input is in the form of a saw-tooth wave.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5985-7429</oboInOwl:created_by>
