        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A technique used to measure the levels of oxygen in a sample by measuring the enhancement of relaxation rates (proportional to O2 concentration) of paramagnetic species (&apos;labels&apos; or &apos;probes&apos;, e.g. nitroxides) in solution with O2, using ESR spectroscopy.</owl:annotatedTarget>
