        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0000288"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Spectroscopy where the spontaneous fluorescence intensity fluctuations of a sample are measured and correlated within a very small detection volume. Ultraviolet light is used to stimulate fluorescence and the sample is held inside a single fused silica microcapillary under high pressure (up to 300 MPa).</obo:IAO_0000115>
