        <obo:IAO_0000115>A method of growing a single crystal &apos;ingot&apos; or &apos;boule&apos;. The polycrystalline sample is heated in a container above its melting point and slowly cooled from one end where a seed crystal is located. Single crystal material is then progressively formed along the length of the container.</obo:IAO_0000115>
