        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0002213"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A process for forming thermoplastic polymer samples by dipping a mould into a solution of the polymer and drawing off the solvent to leave a polymer film adhering to the mould.</obo:IAO_0000115>
