        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0002231"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any technique used to purify a sample by forcing it to pass from the solid to gas phase without passing through an intermediate liquid phase.</obo:IAO_0000115>
