        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of laser spectroscopy where a dye laser is used to remove, from an inhomogeneously broadened spectral line, a narrow homogenous line causing the appearance of a dip ( or &apos;hole&apos;) in a spectrum.</obo:IAO_0000115>
