        <obo:IAO_0000115>A synthesis method for semiconducting single-walled carbon nanotubes where as-grown single-walled carbon nanotubes are treated with a methane plasma at 400–600 °C in a vacuum and the metallic single-walled carbon nanotubes are selectively etched.</obo:IAO_0000115>
