        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A synthesis method where a substrate is placed in a heated atmosphere (600–800 °C) and exposed to one or more volatile precursors, which react or decompose on the surface to produce a deposit.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physe.2004.04.016</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
