        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0001602"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A process for transferring a substance from an aqueous phase to an organic phase (or vice versa) by injecting one phase into a glass chamber using a conventional microsyringe and holding the microlitre droplet at the outlet tip of a PTFE connecting tube. The other phase then flows continuously over the droplet, allowing mass transfer to occur.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5985-7429</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2009-09-15T03:21:04Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
