        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>1H-13C HMQC</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>1H-13C heteronuclear multiple quantum coherence</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
