        <owl:annotatedTarget>The process of removing a thin layer of a sample surface using short pulses of an oxygen plasma (a partially ionised gas containing free electrons and radicals e.g. O, O+ and O2+).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0640-0422</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
