        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0000608"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of heteronuclear NMR spectroscopy where a second frequency dimension is employed, based on the nuclear Overhauser enhancement effect in which correlations are seen between 6Li and 1H nuclei that are spatially proximate within a molecule (&lt;=6 \AA apart).</obo:IAO_0000115>
