        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0000330"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Spectroscopy where the response of an atom with an unpaired electron to short (ns) pulses of microwave radiation in a magnetic field is measured. The microwave radiation used has an approximate frequency of 9 GHz, known as the &apos;X-band&apos;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
