        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Spectroscopy where the response of an atom with an unpaired electron to short (ns) pulses of microwave radiation in a magnetic field is measured. The microwave radiation used has an approximate frequency of 9 GHz, known as the &apos;X-band&apos;.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://doi.org/10.1039/b917410a</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
