        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0002682"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A piece of apparatus, consisting of a light source, a polariser, a compensator (which elliptically polarises the light) and a detector, which is used to measure the intensity and change in polarisation of light reflected by a sample as a function of wavelength. This information in turn can be used to determine refractive index and thin film thickness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
