        <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>&apos;reference material&apos; in IUPAC Compendium of Chemical Terminology, 5th ed. International Union of Pure and Applied Chemistry; 2025. Online version 5.0.0, 2025. https://doi.org/10.1351/goldbook.R05230</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
