        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A Mass analyzer is a device that separates ions according to their mass-to-charge ratio. All mass spectrometers are based on dynamics of charged particles in electric and magnetic fields in vacuum where the two laws of Lorentz force law and Newton&apos;s second law of motion apply.</obo:IAO_0000115>
