        <obo:IAO_0000111>microscopy assay</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>Lung, liver, and spleen tissue samples were collected from female BALB/c mice and fixed in 100% formalin solution, embedded in paraffin, sectioned, and stained with hematoxylin and eosin. The stained samples were examined for signs of pathological changes under light microscopy.</obo:IAO_0000112>
